{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":36.18000030517578,"text":"Around AD 312, the Emperor Constantine had a seated statue of himself made, 12 meters tall, inside a huge basilica in the Forum. Only the head, arms, and legs were marble. The body was brick and wood, probably covered in bronze. When the wood rotted, the marble pieces were what remained. They were found in 1486 and brought here. The head is two and a half meters tall, and each foot is more than two meters long. In 2024, a complete replica of the statue, 13 meters high, was put up in the gardens next to the museum.","words":[{"word":"Around","start":0,"end":0.6800000071525574},{"word":"AD","start":0.6800000071525574,"end":1.2999999523162842},{"word":"312","start":1.2999999523162842,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"the","start":2.359999895095825,"end":2.819999933242798},{"word":"Emperor","start":2.819999933242798,"end":2.819999933242798},{"word":"Constantine","start":2.819999933242798,"end":3.4800000190734863},{"word":"had","start":3.4800000190734863,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"a","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.159999847412109},{"word":"seated","start":4.159999847412109,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"statue","start":4.340000152587891,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"of","start":4.760000228881836,"end":5.380000114440918},{"word":"himself","start":5.380000114440918,"end":5.380000114440918},{"word":"made","start":5.380000114440918,"end":5.639999866485596},{"word":"12","start":5.980000019073486,"end":6.380000114440918},{"word":"meters","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"tall","start":6.659999847412109,"end":7.059999942779541},{"word":"inside","start":7.679999828338623,"end":7.860000133514404},{"word":"a","start":7.860000133514404,"end":8.140000343322754},{"word":"huge","start":8.140000343322754,"end":8.539999961853027},{"word":"basilica","start":8.539999961853027,"end":9.0600004196167},{"word":"in","start":9.0600004196167,"end":9.34000015258789},{"word":"